+/*
+ * The place of the real function is in our interposing table: dyld binds its second column to the
+ * symbol as it was before the table replaced it, which is the libsystem_c entry (dlsym would give
+ * our own replacement back, since it is the one dyld has for the name now).
+ */
+static void *
